# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Distribution and build output directories
bin/
dist/

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Excepción deliberada (F2): runtime legado de SIDC.
#
# Las reglas *.dll / *.exe / *.so de arriba existen para no versionar
# artefactos de build. Estos NO son artefactos de build: son dependencias de
# runtime que el binario embebe (assets/embed.go) para poder instalar SIDC en
# una PC limpia, sin depender de archivos sueltos.
#
# ADVERTENCIA: versionar estos archivos hace que el Release distribuya el
# runtime de Crystal Reports 8 (Seagate/SAP), que es software propietario.
# No es código de este proyecto.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!assets/legacy/crystal/SIDC_CRYSTAL/*.dll
!assets/legacy/crystal/SIDC_CRYSTAL/*.OCX
!assets/legacy/ocx/*.OCX

# Database backups (handled externally by backup-agent)
*.bak

